  "question": {
    "text": "The number of all possible three digit even numbers which can be formed with the condition that if <math><mn>5</mn></math> is one of the digits, then <math><mn>7</mn></math> is the next digit is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>325</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>345</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>365</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "If <math><mn>5</mn></math> is at hundreds place, <math><mn>7</mn></math> will be at tens place and ones place will have <math><mn>0,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4,6</mn></math> or <math><mn>8</mn></math>. So, <math><mn>5</mn></math> numbers are possible.<br />If <math><mn>5</mn></math> is at tens place then, <math><mn>7</mn></math> will be at ones place but it won’t be an even number.<br />If <math><mn>5</mn></math> is at ones place, then it won’t be an even number. So, <math><mn>5</mn></math> can only be at hundreds place<br /><math><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mi></mi><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mi></mi><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mo>→</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4,6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>→</mo><mn>5</mn></math> numbers<br /><math><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mo>×</mo><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mo>×</mo><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mo>=</mo><mn>360</mn></math> numbers<br />(any number except <math><mn>0,5</mn></math> at hundreds place, any number except <math><mn>5</mn></math> at tens place and <math><mn>0,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4,6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></math> at ones place)<br />Total numbers possible <math><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>360</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>365</mn></math>"
  }
}